      <li><strong>Ohio Payroll:</strong> The most accurate free Ohio paycheck calculator available — real IRS brackets, Ohio state tax, and 600+ municipal tax rates</li>
      <li><strong>Business ROI:</strong> Return on investment for real estate, marketing, Amazon FBA, solar panels, business automation, and IT projects</li>
