  <!-- DISCLAIMER -->
  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>Accuracy &amp; Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>We take accuracy seriously. All calculators are reviewed annually and updated when tax laws, IRS brackets, or market benchmarks change. Our financial and payroll calculators cite their sources (IRS Publication 15, Ohio Department of Taxation, Global Property Guide) and are maintained by team members with direct professional experience in each subject area.</p>
    <p><strong>However: our results are estimates, not professional advice.</strong> Tax withholding depends on your specific W-4 elections, employer payroll settings, and individual circumstances. Real estate returns depend on local market conditions, property-specific factors, and financing terms. Always consult a qualified CPA, financial advisor, or licensed real estate professional before making significant financial decisions.</p>
    <p>For questions about our calculators or to report an error, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@americacalculator.com">info@americacalculator.com</a> or use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
